MODULE: NoSpuriousRefusalNoReReadAfterExpiry
TARGET: NoSpuriousRefusal
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: expiry refuses on the cached pre-wait verdict
PERTURBS: ReReadAfterExpiry

--- FIND
        !.writer = IF consumer.expiry = 2 /\ GateValue = 2 THEN "refused" ELSE Response(GateValue),
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: omit the current-verdict re-read.
        !.writer = IF consumer.expiry = 2 THEN "refused" ELSE Response(GateValue),
--- END
